# Files an agent should not read in full: large, generated or binary. Claude Code enforces access
# through "permissions" in .claude/settings.json; this list is for tools that read .claudeignore and
# documents the same intent (see docs/AGENT_SETUP.md, "Context cost"). Search them, do not open them.
uv.lock
*.min.js
orbit/web/static/vendor/
docs/images/
docs/shortcuts/
evals/cases/*.jsonl
evals/cassettes/*.jsonl
evals/results/
tests/fixtures/
tests/prompt_hashes.json
data/namedays_*.json
data/school/
docs/ROUTES.md
docs/TESTMAP.md
.venv/
agent-scratch.db
